 [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"547aed5df02d5b7a43b95f9ee565571d923781fa558fff229f83841ff2ff2ef1","event_uuid":"9f572211-a279-4400-8ac1-5576d32bc722","position":{"commit_sha":"1a6291d14cc240737f28c4f8b962746d6b3092c3","position":"1794524312625542001-9f572211-a279-4400-8ac1-5576d32bc722"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"close_class":"preexisting","comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"HANDOFF STATE 2026-11-12 06:00 PST: in_progress. Fix committed in .rebar/worktrees/fix-cattle as fdbc7398291, not pushed. Reproduced deterministically (background run delayed 6 s -> \"background run never settled\"). The test now captures the run thread run_workflow spawns and joins it (bound 120 s, a hang bound) before reading status once; a hung run still fails; the 6 s run passes; 20 of 20 passed at 4-way concurrency. Next: make verify, push, close after the Bedrock spend cap releases (16:00 PST).","timestamp":1794491827424739151},{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"HANDOFF STATE 2026-11-12 PST: CLOSED (class preexisting, completion signature signed). Change 3378 merged as 765d94ae728. Plan review and close ran through the worktree CLI on the Anthropic API (anthropic:claude-sonnet-5-5) while the Bedrock spend cap held.","timestamp":1794524312625542001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1793818073429425001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"55fdc3da-0afb-46fc-b993-26baa612f2be","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"40c3-d22a-3872-4c8c"},{"link_uuid":"2c033c14-806b-4790-b238-30aaafea9ad5","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"4245-cc44-0f4c-49b1"}],"description":"## Observation\n`tests/interfaces/store/test_workflow_entrypoints.py::test_mcp_run_workflow_is_async_and_pollable` polls `get_workflow_status` 50 times with `time.sleep(0.1)` between polls (lines 134-143). That gives the background `run_workflow` a fixed 5-second wall-clock window to settle, and the test then fails with \"background run never settled\" (line 144).\n\nMeasured on a macOS dev host, 2026-11-04 PST:\n- It failed once in a 4-worker targeted run while `make lint` and `make typecheck` were also running.\n- It failed once more in isolation, minutes later, with other sessions active on the host.\n- It then passed 26 of 26 runs on unmodified `origin/main` (`e0bfa4e5154`), and 30 of 30 further runs with the synonymous-destined-cricket change. 16 runs of each arm were 4-way concurrent.\n\nSo the failure tracks host load, not a code difference. A fixed wall-clock deadline on a background thread's completion is the class of flake AGENTS.md says to root-cause rather than retry.\n\nDiscovered while verifying synonymous-destined-cricket (40c3-d22a-3872-4c8c).\n\n## Testing\n\n`pytest tests/interfaces/store/test_workflow_entrypoints.py -k mcp_run_workflow` passes normally, passes with the background run delayed 6 s, fails when the run never settles, and passes 20 of 20 runs at 4-way concurrency.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] The test waits on the run's own completion signal or a state change, not a fixed 5-second wall clock, and still fails when the run never settles.\n- [x] The test passes 20 of 20 runs under 4-way concurrent load.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/interfaces/store/test_workflow_entrypoints.py","reason":"join the run thread instead of a 5 s poll window"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["relates_to","4245-cc44-0f4c-49b1"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"bd1c7993-f0f9-4c19-a44b-6ecc453b0a4c","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"8797-4707-a264-4ffc","ticket_type":"bug","title":"MCP run_workflow pollable test gives the background run a fixed 5 s wall clock","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["c45d0714-d343-4afc-a4ac-2c76deef3968","d6a51198-e3a6-4e62-a531-a0eef2d393fe","93563286-5734-4089-b2e2-5f0ba90427d9","906a7c11-904f-497a-87ee-8248c46932bb","2c033c14-806b-4790-b238-30aaafea9ad5","3eec8cca-a165-48ce-912f-6724bfd1666c","8d084a11-d759-4243-8c26-23ef98cb8ae6","1dba1b2f-4397-425e-839f-337e633dc829","bd1c7993-f0f9-4c19-a44b-6ecc453b0a4c","90484061-1f5a-4a0e-b59c-89472806e7dc","9f572211-a279-4400-8ac1-5576d32bc722"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794524312625542002,"uuid":"dc9d5780-adc4-4ad9-9192-d94af3fcdbab"}